41
00:01:30,110 --> 00:01:35,240
EPISODE 46:
THE BEGINNING OF THE CENTURY

42
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:32,690
Here, I brought your uniforms!

43
00:01:32,690 --> 00:01:33,940
Wowww!

44
00:01:33,940 --> 00:01:35,740
White with blue stripes...

45
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:39,200
After all, our home uniforms are the best for our final match.

46
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:39,870
Yes!

47
00:01:39,870 --> 00:01:43,700
We washed them all properly, so do your best tomorrow!

48
00:01:43,700 --> 00:01:45,750
Of course! You can count on us!

49
00:01:45,750 --> 00:01:48,380
Only one match remains on our path to the dreamed 3rd championship...

50
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:49,130
You're right.

51
00:01:49,130 --> 00:01:54,670
At least for the final match, I truly wished Tsubasa was in his best form.

52
00:01:54,670 --> 00:01:56,090
Right.

53
00:01:56,090 --> 00:01:58,930
That's why Tsubasa is staying at the hospital tonight.

54
00:01:58,930 --> 00:02:02,640
Nakazawa, get up early tomorrow and take his uniform!

55
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,430
O-Okay.

56
00:02:06,770 --> 00:02:07,690
"I'll keep it short.

57
00:02:07,690 --> 00:02:11,440
I am writing this letter to ask a favor of you, Mr. Makoto Kitazume,

58
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:15,360
the coach of Toho Academy.

59
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:21,070
Coach Kitazume, please let Kojiro Hyuga play in the final match.

60
00:02:21,070 --> 00:02:24,080
I assume you haven't let him play because he left the team

61
00:02:24,080 --> 00:02:29,870
to come see me in Okinawa.

62
00:02:29,870 --> 00:02:33,550
But can't you forgive him? Just this once?

63
00:02:33,550 --> 00:02:36,340
I was the one who called him."

64
00:02:42,430 --> 00:02:43,300
Come in.

65
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,810
Hmm...?

66
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:48,940
Coach.

67
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:52,270
We all discussed it and decided together.

68
00:02:52,270 --> 00:02:54,440
Considering this, please listen to us.

69
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:59,030
Please, let Captain Hyuga play in tomorrow's final.

70
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:04,370
If you refuse to comply with our request,

71
00:03:04,370 --> 00:03:05,620
we...

72
00:03:05,620 --> 00:03:07,660
Captain...?

73
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:09,870
Captain!

74
00:03:09,870 --> 00:03:11,040
Hyuga-san!

75
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:20,840
Coach.

76
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,930
Please, accept this.

77
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:26,680
LETTER OF CHALLENGE

78
00:03:24,550 --> 00:03:25,720
T-This...

79
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:26,680
Hyuga-san!

80
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,980
Captain!

81
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:33,020
LETTER OF CHALLENGE

82
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:41,650
Tonight at 8 o'clock, I will be waiting for you on the Toho Football Club field.

83
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:10,430
Does Hyuga-san really intend to duel him?

84
00:04:24,740 --> 00:04:26,280
Captain...!

85
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:29,870
I would truly rather die than do this...

86
00:04:29,870 --> 00:04:30,750
But,

87
00:04:31,500 --> 00:04:33,040
I must say now,

88
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:36,580
this is quite humiliating.

89
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:37,840
I beg you!

90
00:04:37,840 --> 00:04:40,090
Please let me play in the match!

91
00:04:46,050 --> 00:04:47,970
Raise your head, Hyuga.

92
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:54,730
I have always coached football teams based on my beliefs.

93
00:04:54,730 --> 00:04:59,020
I have never betrayed these beliefs.

94
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:03,030
The foundations upon which my coaching is built are my pride.

95
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:07,320
And staying true to those beliefs, I cannot let you play in this match!

96
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:09,950
Do you understand?!

97
00:05:12,540 --> 00:05:14,160
Hyuga-san...

98
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,670
I see...

99
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:24,550
I truly don't know your beliefs nor do I care;

100
00:05:24,550 --> 00:05:26,680
then, there is nothing else to do!

101
00:05:27,970 --> 00:05:29,890
I will definitely play!

102
00:05:29,890 --> 00:05:33,470
Even if I have to beat you up, I'll get into that match!

103
00:05:33,470 --> 00:05:35,940
Toho doesn't belong to you!

104
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,940
I won't let you do as you please!

105
00:05:37,940 --> 00:05:41,020
You're the only one doing whatever they want here!

106
00:05:42,030 --> 00:05:42,690
Damn it!

107
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,320
Wait a minute, Captain!

108
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,820
Coach, you wait too!

109
00:05:48,820 --> 00:05:50,410
You guys...

110
00:05:53,330 --> 00:05:55,210
As you can see, coach!

111
00:05:55,210 --> 00:05:57,290
Please let Hyuga-san play in this match!

112
00:05:58,080 --> 00:06:01,040
It's true; our Captain left the team without your permission.

113
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:05,130
But in Okinawa, as preparation for our match against Nankatsu,

114
00:06:05,130 --> 00:06:06,800
to defeat Nankatsu,

115
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,390
he trained more intensely than all of us!

116
00:06:09,390 --> 00:06:10,890
We beg you, Coach!

117
00:06:10,890 --> 00:06:13,060
Please, you must let our Captain play!

118
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,100
Coach, please!

119
00:06:14,100 --> 00:06:15,930
You guys...

120
00:06:15,930 --> 00:06:19,310
Are you all going this far for Hyuga...?

121
00:06:26,070 --> 00:06:28,240
Someone bring a ball here.

122
00:06:30,570 --> 00:06:35,580
Hyuga, you just said that Toho isn't mine, didn't you?

123
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:39,370
However, I am the coach, and I make the decisions here.

124
00:06:39,370 --> 00:06:45,130
And in this case, even without you, Toho advanced to the finals.

125
00:06:45,130 --> 00:06:48,970
The power behind that success is our forward, Sorimachi,

126
00:06:48,970 --> 00:06:51,180
our midfielder, Sawada,

127
00:06:51,180 --> 00:06:53,390
and our goalkeeper, Wakashimazu.

128
00:06:53,850 --> 00:06:56,980
If you can steal a goal from these three,

129
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:58,430
Hyuga,

130
00:06:58,430 --> 00:07:00,060
then I will let you play in the match.

131
00:07:02,400 --> 00:07:04,860
You won't go back on your word, will you?

132
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:08,900
However! If they play easy because you're friends,

133
00:07:08,900 --> 00:07:10,450
I won't let you play!

134
00:07:10,450 --> 00:07:12,320
You can't fool my eyes.

135
00:07:12,320 --> 00:07:14,200
Do you guys understand?

136
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:15,830
Y-Yes!

137
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:24,920
We really can't fool our coach.

138
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:26,090
Blow the whistle!

139
00:07:26,090 --> 00:07:27,010
Yes!

140
00:07:27,670 --> 00:07:28,590
Let's go!

141
00:07:28,590 --> 00:07:29,170
Okay!

142
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,930
Here we come, Hyuga-san!

143
00:07:33,470 --> 00:07:35,890
Coach Kira opened my eyes,

144
00:07:35,890 --> 00:07:38,270
and helped me understand how weak I was.

145
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:41,730
Kojiro! You must fight with your body in football!

146
00:07:41,730 --> 00:07:44,900
No matter what, don't let go of your fighting spirit!

147
00:07:44,900 --> 00:07:46,690
Okay!

148
00:07:47,360 --> 00:07:48,860
Fighting spirit!

149
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:52,700
I've drilled that into my head! It's etched into my bones!

150
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,700
To answer Coach Kira's expectations,

151
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:58,450
who straightened me out again,

152
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,460
I'll play in that match!

153
00:08:05,210 --> 00:08:11,010
Last summer, in the middle of a typhoon, I found it on the sandy beaches north of Okinawa!

154
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:13,680
Tiger...

155
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:19,720
Tiger Shot

156
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,720
Shot!

157
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:22,770
What?!

158
00:08:22,770 --> 00:08:24,850
I couldn't see it! Truly!

159
00:08:32,990 --> 00:08:34,320
It's not like you think!

160
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:35,990
I didn't play easy!

161
00:08:35,990 --> 00:08:37,580
That shot was too fast, I...

162
00:08:37,580 --> 00:08:39,330
Couldn't even react!

163
00:08:40,370 --> 00:08:42,290
I will announce the starting members

164
00:08:42,290 --> 00:08:44,080
for tomorrow's match against Nankatsu!

165
00:08:44,790 --> 00:08:46,960
Goalkeeper: Wakashimazu.

166
00:08:47,710 --> 00:08:48,500
Your answer?

167
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:49,960
O-Okay!

168
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,210
Defenders: Imai.

169
00:08:51,210 --> 00:08:51,670
Okay!

170
00:08:51,670 --> 00:08:52,090
Kawabe.

171
00:08:52,090 --> 00:08:52,510
Okay!

172
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,010
Takashima.

173
00:08:53,010 --> 00:08:53,420
Okay!

174
00:08:53,420 --> 00:08:53,880
Furuta.

175
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:54,260
Okay!

176
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,640
Midfielders: Shimano.

177
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,090
Okay!

178
00:08:56,090 --> 00:08:56,550
Koike.

179
00:08:56,550 --> 00:08:56,840
Okay!

180
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,350
Matsuki.

181
00:08:57,350 --> 00:08:57,890
Okay!

182
00:08:57,890 --> 00:08:58,470
Sawada.

183
00:08:58,470 --> 00:08:59,430
Okay!

184
00:08:59,430 --> 00:09:01,680
And forwards: right wing, Sorimachi.

185
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,390
Okay!

186
00:09:02,390 --> 00:09:04,600
And on the left wing...

187
00:09:06,150 --> 00:09:07,150
Kojiro Hyuga!

188
00:09:07,150 --> 00:09:08,400
Okay!

189
00:09:15,820 --> 00:09:20,030
And finally, the dawn of the day of the grand final.

190
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:24,710
TOHO ACADEMY PRESIDENT

191
00:09:21,950 --> 00:09:24,710
NAOKI MIZAWA

192
00:09:22,250 --> 00:09:24,710
Can you tell me why?

193
00:09:24,710 --> 00:09:26,790
Why?

194
00:09:24,710 --> 00:09:26,790
RESIGNATION LETTER

195
00:09:26,790 --> 00:09:30,710
The reason I'm quitting is that Kojiro Hyuga is playing in today's match.

196
00:09:30,710 --> 00:09:31,920
What—

197
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:36,510
Up until now, I have coached according to my own beliefs.

198
00:09:36,510 --> 00:09:38,200
But I broke those beliefs

199
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:41,470
and promised to let Hyuga play in this match.

200
00:09:41,470 --> 00:09:46,020
In other words, I have failed as a coach.

201
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:48,020
I will take responsibility for that,

202
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:51,020
and I will stop coaching at Toho Academy.

203
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:54,490
Coach Kitazume...

204
00:09:54,490 --> 00:09:57,200
But rest assured.

205
00:09:57,200 --> 00:10:00,750
If I am letting Kojiro Hyuga play,

206
00:10:00,750 --> 00:10:04,290
it is for Toho Academy's victory.

207
00:10:05,500 --> 00:10:06,790
Listen to me, everyone!

208
00:10:06,790 --> 00:10:11,540
I want you to give everything you have and make more noise in today's match.

209
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:15,550
Our cheers must definitely reach the players.

210
00:10:15,550 --> 00:10:18,510
Nankatsu will definitely emerge victorious today!

211
00:10:18,510 --> 00:10:19,550
Yes!

212
00:10:19,550 --> 00:10:22,680
NAKATA HOSPITAL

213
00:10:26,850 --> 00:10:29,770
Doctor, how is Tsubasa?

214
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:34,150
If he pushes himself too hard and gets injured again,

215
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:39,280
it could cast a shadow over Tsubasa-kun's football career for the rest of his life.

216
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:44,410
If we care about his future, as his doctor, I should stop him.

217
00:10:44,410 --> 00:10:46,910
I understand what you're saying.

218
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:48,920
What's Tsubasa's opinion on this?

219
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,420
Well...

220
00:10:51,080 --> 00:10:54,880
Doctor, even if you tell me it's impossible, I will still play in tomorrow's match.

221
00:10:54,880 --> 00:10:58,420
But you'll be jeopardizing your career as a football player...

222
00:10:58,420 --> 00:11:00,380
I'm sure Hyuga-kun will play.

223
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:02,640
I can only return the favor gracefully.

224
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:06,100
I understand.

225
00:11:06,100 --> 00:11:07,810
Then please, let him play.

226
00:11:10,020 --> 00:11:13,310
If Tsubasa says he'll play, let him play.

227
00:11:13,310 --> 00:11:16,070
Even if they lose when he plays,

228
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:20,400
even if he can't become the world's number 1 football player because he's injured in this match,

229
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:25,910
Tsubasa isn't a child who will regret choosing to play in this match.

230
00:11:26,410 --> 00:11:28,200
Ozora-san...

231
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,830
Good morning!

232
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:31,370
Ah, Sanae-chan...

233
00:11:31,370 --> 00:11:33,580
I brought Tsubasa-kun's uniform.

234
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:35,380
Really? Thank you!

235
00:11:35,380 --> 00:11:38,130
You're very strong, Mrs. Ozora.

236
00:11:38,130 --> 00:11:43,470
With his injuries that bad, if it were me, I wouldn't let him play.

237
00:11:44,600 --> 00:11:46,140
Sanae-chan...

238
00:11:48,310 --> 00:11:50,060
Good morning, everyone!

239
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:51,140
Tsubasa-kun!

240
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,100
Hey!

241
00:11:52,100 --> 00:11:55,730
Doctor, it's time for the taping for the match. Please!

242
00:11:55,730 --> 00:11:57,320
O-Okay...

243
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,860
Hey, Tsubasa!

244
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:00,360
Are you ready?

245
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:06,200
Ah, everyone!

246
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:11,250
Tsubasa! Today is our last official match as middle school students!

247
00:12:11,250 --> 00:12:15,130
Let's gather up and go there together for the final match!

248
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,500
Tsubasa!

249
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:19,960
Everyone...

250
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,010
Tsubasa-kun.

251
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,050
Here, take this.

252
00:12:26,050 --> 00:12:26,970
Okay.

253
00:12:26,970 --> 00:12:28,260
Thanks!

254
00:12:28,970 --> 00:12:30,220
So lucky...

255
00:12:30,770 --> 00:12:32,600
I wish I could have, even once,

256
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:33,520
just like that,

257
00:12:34,350 --> 00:12:38,520
been by Tsubasa senpai's side, this summer...

258
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,240
No, I can't! What am I thinking?!

259
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:44,070
Yukari-san! Please hit me!

260
00:12:44,070 --> 00:12:44,910
What...?

261
00:12:44,910 --> 00:12:47,240
W-What are you saying?

262
00:12:56,830 --> 00:12:57,630
They're here!

263
00:12:58,250 --> 00:12:59,630
Toho is here!

264
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:09,010
TOHO ACADEMY

265
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:09,010
10:15: ARRIVAL AT STADIUM

266
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:11,890
And here's Nankatsu!

267
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:21,190
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL

268
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:21,190
10:17: ARRIVAL AT STADIUM

269
00:13:21,190 --> 00:13:23,530
This is my last official match in Japan,

270
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:26,660
and also my last one as a middle schooler.

271
00:13:26,660 --> 00:13:29,780
It's also the match where I'll say goodbye to everyone.

272
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:37,630
~Anime Lovers~
