273
00:13:40,590 --> 00:13:43,260
Do your best, do your best, Nankatsu!

274
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:46,220
Fight, fight, Toho!

275
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:49,140
Wow, what a crowd.

276
00:13:49,140 --> 00:13:50,760
It'll be hard to find a seat.

277
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:52,350
Matsuyama-kun!

278
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:54,020
We're over here!

279
00:13:54,020 --> 00:13:55,850
Oh, Misugi and Yayoi!

280
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:57,690
Thanks.

281
00:13:57,690 --> 00:13:59,810
You were so close yesterday.

282
00:13:59,810 --> 00:14:02,730
Yes, but it was a match I don't regret.

283
00:14:02,730 --> 00:14:04,400
In a way, I was satisfied.

284
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,780
Are you the only one left behind?

285
00:14:06,780 --> 00:14:07,990
Yes.

286
00:14:07,990 --> 00:14:12,740
The coach told me I need to watch this match for future benefit.

287
00:14:12,740 --> 00:14:15,160
Also, if I went back with them...

288
00:14:15,160 --> 00:14:18,210
Captain, why did you go after her all the way to the airport?

289
00:14:18,210 --> 00:14:20,080
What did you two talk about?

290
00:14:20,080 --> 00:14:23,380
Hey, hey! You like Yoshiko too, don't you, Matsuyama-kun?!

291
00:14:25,210 --> 00:14:27,800
It was bound to end like this.

292
00:14:28,180 --> 00:14:30,930
You two are so lucky, being together all this time...

293
00:14:30,930 --> 00:14:32,300
Huh?

294
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,390
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

295
00:14:33,310 --> 00:14:34,390
Excuse me.

296
00:14:35,310 --> 00:14:38,390
You must be Coach Kitazume of Toho Academy.

297
00:14:40,810 --> 00:14:42,980
Did you read my letter?

298
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:45,150
My name is Kozo Kira.

299
00:14:45,610 --> 00:14:46,610
Kira?

300
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:50,410
As you can see.

301
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:53,910
I beg of you, please let Kojiro play in today's match!

302
00:14:54,740 --> 00:14:56,370
Coach Kira!

303
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:57,370
Kira-san.

304
00:14:57,370 --> 00:14:58,750
Please raise your head.

305
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:01,580
Certainly not unless I hear he's playing today.

306
00:15:02,040 --> 00:15:03,380
Don't worry.

307
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:05,800
Hyuga will be playing the whole match today.

308
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:07,260
Ha–

309
00:15:07,260 --> 00:15:08,340
Is that true?!

310
00:15:08,800 --> 00:15:09,680
Yes.

311
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:13,510
Last night, Hyuga did what you are doing right now.

312
00:15:13,510 --> 00:15:14,850
Kojiro...

313
00:15:15,810 --> 00:15:17,020
Coach...

314
00:15:18,810 --> 00:15:23,400
Now, both teams have taken the field for pre-game warm-up.

315
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:24,900
Nankatsu!

316
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:26,030
Tsubasa!

317
00:15:26,030 --> 00:15:28,280
Hyuga, you must play today!

318
00:15:28,740 --> 00:15:32,070
I will now announce the starting players for both teams.

319
00:15:32,070 --> 00:15:36,910
Nankatsu MS, representing Shizuoka Prefecture, will wear their white uniforms.

320
00:15:37,830 --> 00:15:40,960
As goalkeeper, Morisaki-kun.

321
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:47,630
As defenders, Nakazato-kun, Oda-kun, Takasugi-kun, and Ishizaki-kun.

322
00:15:47,630 --> 00:15:48,420
Heh.

323
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:51,840
For midfielders, Ozora Tsubasa-kun...

324
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:54,890
So you'll play today too, huh?

325
00:15:54,890 --> 00:15:56,350
Good job! Never mind the injuries!

326
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:58,100
It wouldn't be fun without you!

327
00:15:58,680 --> 00:16:00,940
God, look how popular he is.

328
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:03,480
There's not even a bit of room for us here!

329
00:16:03,480 --> 00:16:05,940
Being popular must be fun and nice!

330
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:11,240
And now: Toho Academy, representing Tokyo, will wear their black uniforms.

331
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:13,860
As goalkeeper, Wakashimazu-kun.

332
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:21,120
As defenders, Furuta-kun, Kawade-kun, Imai-kun, and Takashima-kun.

333
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:27,750
As midfielders, Sawada-kun, Koike-kun, Shimada-kun, and Matsuki-kun.

334
00:16:27,750 --> 00:16:29,760
Forwards, Sorimachi-kun...

335
00:16:31,090 --> 00:16:32,340
And Hyuga-kun.

336
00:16:33,010 --> 00:16:34,390
Hyuga is playing?

337
00:16:34,390 --> 00:16:36,720
We've been waiting for you, Toho's Ace!

338
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:39,430
Look at those cheers.

339
00:16:39,430 --> 00:16:45,400
The crowd was desperately waiting for Hyuga-kun to play in the match!

340
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,560
Hyuga!

341
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,400
So you made it.

342
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:48,730
I will.

343
00:16:48,730 --> 00:16:51,150
I will definitely take the championship!

344
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:58,990
After finishing their warm-ups, both teams are heading to the locker rooms.

345
00:16:58,990 --> 00:17:00,490
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

346
00:17:01,660 --> 00:17:02,660
Captain...!

347
00:17:02,660 --> 00:17:05,920
Were you really wearing a sweater under your uniform in this heat?

348
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:10,000
I wasn't exactly sitting on the bench doing nothing.

349
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:13,380
I made my preparations for this burning sun.

350
00:17:13,380 --> 00:17:15,550
This amount of heat won't tire me out.

351
00:17:15,970 --> 00:17:21,810
The hotter it is in the match, the more advantageous it will be for me.

352
00:17:21,810 --> 00:17:23,060
Captain!

353
00:17:23,060 --> 00:17:26,980
His muscles look even stronger even after such a short time.

354
00:17:26,980 --> 00:17:31,280
Hyuga-san has returned with a body like forged steel.

355
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:35,780
RESIGNATION LETTER

356
00:17:34,280 --> 00:17:35,780
Okay, boys, listen up.

357
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,110
Have confidence!

358
00:17:37,110 --> 00:17:40,450
You can definitely win with your current strength.

359
00:17:40,450 --> 00:17:42,830
It's the perfect time to dethrone Nankatsu!

360
00:17:42,830 --> 00:17:45,580
We'll return to Toho Academy with the championship flag!

361
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:46,580
Okay!

362
00:17:46,580 --> 00:17:49,080
Yeah, we'll do it this year!

363
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,840
I guess I'll worry about that after the match.

364
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,050
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

365
00:17:52,340 --> 00:17:55,050
I won't waste my time on trivial things.

366
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:59,430
All you have to do is play like you always do.

367
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:00,470
Okay!

368
00:18:00,470 --> 00:18:04,480
Tsubasa, anything else to add as captain?

369
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,560
Yes.

370
00:18:08,310 --> 00:18:10,810
I'm very happy that I was accepted into Nankatsu MS

371
00:18:10,810 --> 00:18:16,240
and was able to play football with you for these last three years.

372
00:18:16,240 --> 00:18:19,410
In our final showdown today, after coming this far...

373
00:18:19,410 --> 00:18:21,450
Let's win and make our 3rd championship a reality!

374
00:18:21,450 --> 00:18:22,950
Yes!

375
00:18:22,950 --> 00:18:25,120
Alright, boys!

376
00:18:23,410 --> 00:18:25,000
Nankatsu, it's time!

377
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:26,160
Okay.

378
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,620
Okay, let's go, everyone!

379
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:29,080
Yes!

380
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:30,420
Tsubasa-kun.

381
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:31,130
Take this.

382
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:32,840
Of course.

383
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:37,590
My last match as Nankatsu captain.

384
00:18:37,590 --> 00:18:40,720
I will make my middle school football career undefeated,

385
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:46,350
and this time I'll go to Brazil, Roberto's country!

386
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:48,390
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

387
00:18:46,350 --> 00:18:48,390
Toho, it's time!

388
00:18:48,390 --> 00:18:50,650
Let's go, everyone!

389
00:18:50,650 --> 00:18:51,400
Yes!

390
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,820
We'll do it!

391
00:18:52,820 --> 00:18:53,860
We'll dethrone Nankatsu!

392
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:54,610
That's it!

393
00:18:55,820 --> 00:18:58,700
When I think about it, they're all my little clever players.

394
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:03,870
They've succeeded in enduring my long, tough training.

395
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:06,620
How's your condition, Tsubasa?

396
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:07,540
No problem.

397
00:19:07,540 --> 00:19:09,750
Even if I get hurt during this, I'll do my best.

398
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:11,880
That's the spirit.

399
00:19:12,330 --> 00:19:13,880
Doctor!

400
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:16,460
I'll take care of you after the match.

401
00:19:16,460 --> 00:19:19,220
You're still going to play, so give it everything you've got!

402
00:19:19,970 --> 00:19:24,890
The final match of the National Middle School Football Tournament is about to begin.

403
00:19:24,890 --> 00:19:27,220
Both teams are emerging.

404
00:19:28,640 --> 00:19:30,020
Big brother!

405
00:19:30,020 --> 00:19:34,860
Nankatsu MS, representing Shizuoka, against Toho Academy, representing Tokyo.

406
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:37,480
NAGASAKI
HIRADO MS

407
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:39,860
We've been seeing the same final match for the last three years.

408
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:42,910
I'm sure both teams, starting with their best members,

409
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:42,910
OSAKA
AZUMAICHI MS

410
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:45,120
will show us

411
00:19:42,910 --> 00:19:45,120
AKITA
TACHIBANA HOUSE

412
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:50,870
a great game in the 60 minutes of the match that we won't be able to take our eyes off.

413
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:48,120
WAKASHIMAZU HOUSE

414
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:57,420
Honey, will you really make Ken quit football if he loses?

415
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:59,970
That was the condition for letting him play up until now.

416
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:03,760
Ken is fully aware of it in every match.

417
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:07,560
The ball goes to Toho Academy by coin toss.

418
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:09,520
It's been a long time since I've been on the field.

419
00:20:09,520 --> 00:20:12,560
Please, everyone, lend me your strength.

420
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:15,730
The first year of the middle school tournament...

421
00:20:17,730 --> 00:20:20,030
Tsubasa-kun takes an overhead shot!

422
00:20:20,030 --> 00:20:22,110
Nankatsu captured their first championship!

423
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:23,570
Last year...

424
00:20:23,570 --> 00:20:24,240
Let's go!

425
00:20:24,240 --> 00:20:25,320
Yes!

426
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:26,740
In that tournament too...

427
00:20:28,790 --> 00:20:30,040
It's in!

428
00:20:30,040 --> 00:20:33,210
Nankatsu achieved their 2nd championship, reigning nationwide!

429
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:37,540
I refuse to lose any more, Tsubasa.

430
00:20:37,540 --> 00:20:41,220
With this final match of my middle school life for the last 3 years,

431
00:20:41,220 --> 00:20:44,930
I'll repay the humiliation I've felt.

432
00:20:45,340 --> 00:20:47,220
The match will start at noon.

433
00:20:47,220 --> 00:20:49,930
The moment of destiny approaches!

434
00:20:49,930 --> 00:20:51,020
5,4,3,2,1,0!

435
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:51,930
5,4,3,2,1,0!

