00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:55,190
5,4,3,2,1,0!

439
00:20:55,190 --> 00:20:56,190
5,4,3,2,1,0!

440
00:20:58,020 --> 00:20:59,780
The match finally begins!

441
00:20:59,780 --> 00:21:03,820
The whistle blows loud and clear for the match of the century!

442
00:21:04,240 --> 00:21:05,450
Let's go, everyone!

443
00:21:05,450 --> 00:21:06,320
Yes!

444
00:21:10,410 --> 00:21:15,420
Hyuga prepares to shoot from the center line!

445
00:21:16,380 --> 00:21:17,630
What?!

446
00:21:17,630 --> 00:21:18,590
Here it comes.

447
00:21:18,590 --> 00:21:20,550
It was clear from the start!

448
00:21:20,550 --> 00:21:22,970
I was right to stay back!

449
00:21:23,630 --> 00:21:25,380
Eat this, Nankatsu!

450
00:21:25,380 --> 00:21:26,550
This is my...

451
00:21:27,890 --> 00:21:30,810
Tiger Shot!

452
00:21:27,890 --> 00:21:30,810
Tiger Shot

453
00:21:34,390 --> 00:21:34,890
Fast!

454
00:21:34,890 --> 00:21:36,790
Hyuga-kun's long shot,

455
00:21:36,790 --> 00:21:41,110
advances on a low trajectory towards Nankatsu's goal!

456
00:21:43,610 --> 00:21:45,900
It hit the post!

457
00:21:45,900 --> 00:21:49,490
Goalkeeper Morisaki-kun is stunned right now, can't move an inch!

458
00:21:49,490 --> 00:21:51,240
Damn it!

459
00:21:52,910 --> 00:21:56,000
Ahh, the ball burst!

460
00:21:57,000 --> 00:21:58,540
What a magnificent shot!

461
00:21:58,540 --> 00:21:59,880
As expected of you, Hyuga!

462
00:21:59,880 --> 00:22:00,880
Big brother!

463
00:22:00,880 --> 00:22:02,710
Such power...

464
00:22:02,710 --> 00:22:07,890
Did Hyuga-kun develop a tremendous shot in such a short time...?

465
00:22:07,890 --> 00:22:08,680
Damn it!

466
00:22:09,390 --> 00:22:12,970
The final match has started in a shocking way!

467
00:22:12,970 --> 00:22:17,480
The Wild Tiger, Kojiro Hyuga, makes his perfect comeback!

